// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SCInstructions 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3938664253" "Crey's Folly briefing"
// DetailString :
"P3981225885" "It wasn't long ago that Crey's Folly was the center of industry in Paragon City.  Back in the 1980's, Crey chose it as the site for most of their facilities.  But all their holdings turned to rubble when the area became a major target in the Rikti War.  Before long, people started calling the place Crey's Folly.  Now, the Freakshow has their hooks in the place.  The Freaks would be no worse than any other street thugs, if not for their state-of-the-art cybernetic equipment.  Armed with that kind of power, the Freakshow have set up their own little kingdom in Crey's Folly. <color orange>It's generally a good idea to enter this zone with at least a couple of other heroes.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2984992497" "The Freakshow's presence on Crey's Folly is becoming a stranglehold.  Talk to the Security Chief and see if you can make a dent."
// AcceptString :
"P2287017492" "Talk to the Crey's Folly Security Chief"
// SendOffString :
"P1397370856" "Good luck, {HeroName}."

