// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - WB_Hero_Liaison_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3540478900" "<color red>This mission involves the PvP zone 'Warburg'.  While conducting missions in this zone, you may be attacked by other hostile players.  Only accept this mission if you are willing to experience PvP content</color> <br><br>Things are dicey over in Warburg.  There's a rogue Arachnos Marshal in charge of the place, not to mention every villain and his mother roaming the streets looking for a chance to grab some power.  You should speak to the <color orange>Longbow Warburg Liaison over in Kings Row</color>.  She can tell you more about the zone and how to get there. <color red>Remember that Warburg is a PvP zone.  Only enter Warburg if you're willing to experience Player versus Player content.  Warburg is also a free-fire zone, outside the safe areas, anyone can attack anyone else who isn't part of their team-up.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P497020644" "Talk to Longbow Warburg Liaison"
// SendOffString :
"P1597435819" "<color red>Warburg is a Free-Fire PvP zone.  While in Warburg, you may be attacked and defeated by other players.</color> <br><br>Don't kid yourself; Warburg is pretty dangerous.  You can get to Warburg by using the Helicopter on top of the Police Station in King's Row."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3295057965" "<color red>Warburg is a Free-Fire PvP zone.  While in Warburg, you may be attacked and defeated by other players.</color> <br><br>Don't kid yourself; Warburg is pretty dangerous.  You can get to Warburg by using the helicopter on top of the Police Station in King's Row."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3583953859" "Hello, {HeroName}.  I'm the Longbow Liaison for the Free-Fire PvP zone of Warburg. <color red>Warburg is a Player Vs. Player zone.  It is also free-fire, meaning that anyone can attack anyone else outside of the safe areas, whether they're Heroes or Villains.</color>  Warburg is VERY dangerous, and if you go there, you almost certainly will be attacked by other people. <color red>Do not enter Warburg unless you are willing to engage in Player Vs. Player combat</color>. <br><br>If you are interested in entering Warburg, you can get there by speaking to the helicopter pilot on the roof of the building.  To get to him, enter through the doors behind me.   Once there, you can talk to Warzone Agent Goddard to get missions inside the zone.  He can be found within the safe area."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1196895021" "I hope the Warzone Liaison gave you the info you need to help out in Warburg."
